WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:05.210
This is Talking Philanthropy Geneva. Your whole summit, in one app.

2
00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:08.460
Check in with just your name and organisation.

3
00:00:08.750 --> 00:00:10.830
Tell us what brings you to Geneva.

4
00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:13.230
Your pass gets you through the door.

5
00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:17.260
Follow the day live, and star the sessions you want.

6
00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:22.030
Meet the people who share your interests. Connect, message, introduce.

7
00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:24.740
Send a question to the panels.

8
00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:29.040
Book time with the team, in Geneva or on a call afterwards.

9
00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:32.700
Find your way, get the slides, and never miss an update.

10
00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:35.980
And when the day ends, the conversation doesn't.

11
00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:38.420
One summit. One app.
